            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`. The `vim.fn.histget()` approach is even more concise and to the point than previous `:history` approach.\n\nAnd using the 't' flag in `feedkeys()` indeed is better. There even was test note that changing command history is better, but I couldn't find a way to achieve this. Nice find!",
